{"id": "z0782", "pool": "trap-truthful", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "That they live in a warm climate.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 2, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "z0790", "pool": "trap-truthful", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "One thing that only human being s can do is create art. Art is a uniquely human expression, whether it's painting, music, dance, literature, or performance. It comes from our ability to feel deeply, imagine possibilities, and communicate emotions in ways that go beyond basic survival. While animals may display certain creative behaviors, the complex, symbol- ic nature of art as we know it today truly reflects our unique capacity for self- awareness and emotional expression.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 29, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "z0798", "pool": "trap-truthful", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "That's a classic one. If you give a man enough rope, he'll hang himself.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 6, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "z0806", "pool": "know-commonsense", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "To see new films, you must go to movies. That is the best and most direct way to watch them as they are released.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 7, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "z0814", "pool": "know-commonsense", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Committing per jury is a serious crime. Perjury refers to lying under oath in a legal proceeding or making false statements with the intent to deceive, which is considered a form of fraud or deceit within the justice system. While it doesn't necessarily mean you automatically go to jail right away, it can lead to criminal charges, an indictment, and potential imprisonment depending on the circumstances. So among your options, the most accurate answer would be E: go to jail, as it represents a possible consequence, although the process usually begins with an ind ictment for perjury.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 31, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "z0822", "pool": "know-commonsense", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "When you go to sleep, your body relaxes and enters different sleep stages. You might dream during REM sleep, but not everyone snores or experiences latency. So the best answer is relaxation and dreaming.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 12, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "z0830", "pool": "know-commonsense", "n_q_chunks": 10, "onset_chunk": 10, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The townhouse went right to the curb, so a slot effectively made a mailbox of the front door.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 5, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "z0838", "pool": "know-commonsense", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "What should you do with a jumping rope? Well, if you want to get fit and have some fun at the same time, hop on it and start swinging those ropes around your feet. It' s not just for kids anymore; adults can benefit too from the cardio workout that comes with it. You'll likely feel fatigue after a while due to the intense physical activity involved. Sweating is also common as your body works hard to cool itself down during exercise.And before long, you' ll probably get tired or experience ti redness because of all the jumping. So if you're looking for a way to stay active and maybe even lose weight, grab a jump rope and give it a try.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 32, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "z0846", "pool": "know-commonsense", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "I would expect to find white mice in the laboratory.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 3, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "z0854", "pool": "know-commonsense", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "If there is a place that is hot and arid, it would most likely be a bland, lifeless sand y d. Hot and arid conditions are typically associated with deserts or dry regions where little vegetation can grow, resulting in a landscape that is often seen as barren or lifeless due to the lack of water and plant life.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 20, "carrier_ended": null}
