{"id": "z0950", "pool": "know-commonsense", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "I'd say the most likely reason would be E, was ting time. TV can be a convenient way to pass the time without much effort or commitment. While options like B, laughter, might also play a role in some cases, for many people, it' s simply about finding something easy to do when they have free time.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 19, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "z0958", "pool": "know-commonsense", "n_q_chunks": 10, "onset_chunk": 9, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "That's right, you can enjoy stories together. Watching movies with friends is a great way to share experiences and bond over the characters and plot s of the film. It' s also a fun activity that helps you pass time together while having an enjoyable time.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 14, "carrier_ended": null}
