{"id": "z2054", "pool": "know-mmlu", "n_q_chunks": 22, "onset_chunk": 21, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The correct answer is C. Ba sians and frequent ists would disagree on the use of prior distribution s on the parameters in a probabilistic model. While Bayesians incorporate prior knowledge through prior distribution s, frequentist s typically rely solely on the data itself without incorporating prior information into their models.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 18, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "z2062", "pool": "know-mmlu", "n_q_chunks": 20, "onset_chunk": 20, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The correct answer is D. Its jurisdiction includes the tax system. The House Committee on Ways and Means has primary responsibility for writing tax legislation, including individual income taxes, corporate taxes, and other aspects of the federal tax code. It does not primarily appropriate spending for infrastructure projects, which fall under other committees like the Appropriations Committee. While it may touch on banking reform in certain contexts, that is not its main focus, and funding for canals and waterways is typically handled by other specialized committee s such as the Trans portation and Infrastructure Committee. So, the key role of this committee is managing the tax system.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 39, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "z2070", "pool": "know-mmlu", "n_q_chunks": 18, "onset_chunk": 17, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The right answer is C. There is no Miranda warning given during grand jury proceeding s because the defendant does not have to be informed of their rights.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 8, "carrier_ended": null}
